WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.793
Your work keeps growing.

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:02.593
140 problems.

00:00:02.318 --> 00:00:03.943
A chat app.

00:00:03.943 --> 00:00:04.905
Resume v4.

00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:06.405
But every new chat...

00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:07.205
resets.

00:00:08.436 --> 00:00:09.534
Placiq keeps the context.

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:12.209
So the advice grows with you.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.355
No more resets.
